            Each texture has 64 sub-tiles arranged in an 8x8 pattern.
            </summary>
            <param name="x">Cell X coordinate</param>
            <param name="y">Cell Y coordinate</param>
            <returns>Tuple of (subX, subY) coordinates in range 0-7</returns>
        </member>
